### AIIMS API Testing Suite (REST Client)
### Compatible with humao.rest-client

@baseUrl = http://localhost:5001

### 1. API Health Check
GET {{baseUrl}}/health

### 2. User Authentication (Login)
# @name loginRequest
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "student@aiims.edu",
  "password": "Password123!"
}

### 3. Fetch User Profile
@authToken = {{loginRequest.response.body.token}}
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/users/profile
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### 4. Fetch AI Wallet Recommendations
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/wallet/recommendations
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### 5. Fetch Credits Balance & Ledger
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/credits/balance
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
